    "summary": "Delaware requires all employers with one or more employees to carry Workers' Compensation insurance. Coverage must begin before any employee starts work. The requirement applies to full-time, part-time, temporary, and seasonal workers unless a specific exclusion applies under state law. The source does not specify how coverage is obtained or detail particular exemptions beyond noting that exclusions may exist under state law.",
