    "title": "Florida Insurance Agent and Agency Licensing Overview",
    "summary": "The Florida Department of Financial Services Division of Insurance Agent and Agency Services oversees licensing for insurance agents, adjusters, bail bond agents, navigators, and insurance-related entities. Information on qualifying, applying, education requirements, and compliance is available through the Division. Licensing details cover what each license is used for, qualifications required, and how to maintain it. Continuing education, pre-licensing courses, and state examination information are also provided through the Division's education resources.",
