    "summary": "Hawaii employers must report new hires using the State Directory of New Hires. Employers are also guided by the Hawaii Employer's Guide to Medical Support and the Hawaii Employer's Guide to Income Withholding, which address child support-related obligations. The source page does not provide specific deadlines or numeric thresholds for new-hire reporting.",
