    "summary": "Employers in Hawaii must register for unemployment insurance and are subject to state UI contribution rates. The Hawaii UI division provides an employer website, contribution rate information, and a Certificate of Compliance resource. Employers can file weekly reports of low earnings online and must comply with SUTA dumping rules. Specific tax rates, taxable wage base figures, and filing deadlines are not stated on this source page.",
