    "summary": "Iowa employers pay UI taxes into the UI Trust Fund, with rates varying by benefit ratio rank across four rate tables (0.000% to 5.400%). For 2026, the applicable table is Contribution Rate Table D, the lowest allowed by law. New non-construction employers pay 1.000% and new construction employers pay 5.400% for 2026. The taxable wage base is $20,400.00 for 2026, down from $39,500.00 in 2025.",
