    "summary": "Under Maryland's Fair Wage Act, all employers statewide pay $15 per hour. County rates differ: Montgomery County rates as of July 1, 2026 range from $15.95 to $18.00 depending on employer size; Howard County pays $16 per hour; Prince George's County pays $15.30 as of January 1, 2026. Tipped employees must receive at least $3.63 per hour from employers, with tips bringing total pay to at least the state minimum wage. Most employees must be paid 1.5 times their usual hourly rate for all work over 40 hours per week.",
